# CLAUDE'S TEST CAPSULE: REACTOR READOUT. The reactor's output on a text display, "1234 kW", green in ECO and orange in
# REACTIVE. The bridge and the reactor room each have a display on the same two wires. "1234 kW" is 7 characters, so it
# never has to scroll (sim/label.js).
name capsule_readout
box readout
note "READOUT: HOW IT WORKS" "Text: the reactor's power_value_out, rounded, joined to 'kW' with a space.\nColour: the mode lever (0 = ECO, 1 = REACTIVE) picks green or orange through a multiplexer."
note "WIRING" "in1 <- reactor power_value_out, in2 <- reactor mode lever\nout1 -> text displays set_text, out2 -> text displays set_text_color"
pin in1 reactor.power_value_out
pin in2 const.1
c r round
c kw mem Value=kW
c cat concat Separator=" "
w in1 r.in
w r.out cat.1
w kw.out cat.2
w cat.out out1
c green mem Value="120,255,140,255"
c orange mem Value="255,170,90,255"
c cm mux
w in2 cm.set_input
w green.out cm.signal_in0
w orange.out cm.signal_in1
w cm.out out2
